```console
$ scherzo-cloud organization --help
Manage Scherzo Cloud organizations

Usage: scherzo-cloud organization [COMMAND]

Commands:
  audit       Work with organization audit records
  create      Create an organization
  deletion    Manage an organization deletion schedule
  invitation  Manage organization invitations
  leave       Leave an organization
  list        List your organization memberships
  member      Manage Scherzo Cloud organization members
  show        Show an organization
  update      Update an organization
  help        Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help

```
